<title>CANADA: Canadian dollar opens flat in moderate trading.</title>
<headline>Canadian dollar opens flat in moderate trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3800/1.3890	   ASIAN CLOSE     1.3850</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3740   SUPPORT 1.3890     HI 1.3872   LO  1.3846</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3857/62    HI 1.3872    EUROPE OPEN     1.3852</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3843/48    LO 1.3846    HI 1.3854   LO  1.3752</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar opened virtually flat on Monday at C$1.3847 (US$0.7221) from Friday's close of C$1.3843 (US$0.7223) in moderately active trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>* They said the currency remains under pressure from those who believe the Bank of Canada should raise interest rates and the absence of any buyers other than a modest band of speculators.</p>
</text>
